<section class="hero">
  <h1>STRC Below Par: Discount, or <em>Warning?</em></h1>
  <div class="hero-subtitle">A bitcoin-backed preferred stock, expected to trade near its $100 par value &mdash; yet trading below it.</div>
  <p class="subtitle">A low price is <em>either</em> opportunity <em>or</em> cautionary information. This page shows you both readings of STRC&rsquo;s discount &mdash; with arithmetic, not adjectives &mdash; and lets you watch the contest between the yield the market demands and the balance sheet the issuer can deploy against it &mdash; live.</p>
</section>

