    <p>STRC is Strategy&rsquo;s variable-rate perpetual preferred &mdash; dividends in cash, a stated design goal of trading around $100 par, and a rate the board adjusts monthly to encourage it. Today it trades below par, and that cuts two ways: the same $12 coupon on a sub-$100 price is a higher effective yield &mdash; and a mechanism built to hold the price at par that isn&rsquo;t holding it is telling you the market is pricing a risk. This page shows both readings but recommends neither. For where STRC sits among bitcoin-backed income instruments, see <a href="/bitcoin-fixed-income">Bitcoin and Fixed Income</a>, the parent page.</p>
